title: High-Rate File Modification (Ransomware)
id: 21382ae2-a9a1-4102-9591-c8cc0d81ae00
status: experimental
description: Detects a single process modifying or creating an abnormally high number of files across many directories in a short window, the file-activity signature of active ransomware encryption.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1486/
logsource:
  category: file_event
detection:
  selection:
    EventType: 'modify'
  timeframe: 1m
  condition: selection | count() by Image > 500
  condition: selection
fields:
  - Image
  - TargetFilename
falsepositives:
  - Backup, indexing, or sync software
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1486
